        "id": 1115183
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-26T23:41:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think they\u0027re getting that information from somewhere else now (maybe scaling_available_frequencies?). But it would be more reliable to include it in this file. New version uses the format:\n\ncpu0\n\u003cfreq\u003e: \u003ctime\u003e\n...\ncpu4\n\u003cfreq\u003e: \u003ctime\u003e\n...",
      "parentUuid": "58783130_56951573",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 95,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 96,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "25866078274b014a87e4b03f112d6ee0329a4414",
